#: lesson.yml:title
msgid "Introduction to the PLUMED parallel features for developers"
msgstr "開発者向けの PLUMED 並列機能の入門"

#: lesson.yml:description
msgid ""
"A simple presentation of some of the available features in PLUMED to "
"simplify the interface with OpenMP and MPI. The lesson contains also a very "
"simple example of how to implement a CV with CUDA."
msgstr ""
"OpenMP や MPI との連携を簡単にするために PLUMED で利用できる機能を紹介する。CUDA で CV を実装するごく簡単な例も含む。"
